{"evt":"edge_added","from":"note:note-mqpxr6kyk2y","to":"codex/search-economy-retrieval-phase1","kind":"context","actor":"overlay-sync","ts":"2026-06-23T00:58:20.868Z","weight":1}
{"evt":"note_created","id":"note-mqpxr6kyk2y","workspace":"D:\\zonoid","title":"Fair fetch inclusive cmm retrieval number beats naive on recall and tokens at same code budget","summary":"Re-ran the codebase-memory-mcp arm in LOCATE-then-FETCH mode so it delivers actual source (not just symbol locators), under the same ~12k-char budget as the naive arm: per query, search_graph to rank candidate symbols by query-term-in-name, then get_code_snippet for the top 6, bundle = the concatenated function snippets. Result over the 13-query corpus: mean_recall 0.551, mean_tokens 2554, mean_tokens_per_correct 1113.5, hit 9/13. Versus naive grep+read (0.321 recall, 3026 tokens, 1945 tok/correct), cmm-locate-fetch still wins BOTH axes: 1.7x higher recall AND fewer tokens, ~1.75x better tok/correct. This corrects the earlier headline: the locators-only cmm number (0.506 recall, 327 tokens, 170 tok/correct = 11x better tok/correct) overstated the token edge because it returned symbol POINTERS not code; once cmm delivers real code the edge is a sane ~1.75x, not 11x. The win is real and mechanistic: structural search fills the same code budget with the RIGHT functions (located by name/structure) instead of grep-windowed file chunks. Note recall rose vs locators-only (0.551 vs 0.506) because a fetched function body surfaces neighbor symbols for free (e.g. computeFlow snippet contains splitSessionTokens + sessionCatchalls). Two misses (q01 createWorktree, q04 embed) are a fetch-ranking artifact of the crude top-6 selection, not a location failure, so 0.551 is a conservative floor.","category":"project","tags":["benchmark","codebase-memory-mcp","token-economy","result","fair-comparison"],"created_by":"main","valid_from":"2026-06-23T00:58:20.818Z","vec":[-0.06584880501031876,-0.025846656411886215,-0.05172261968255043,0.010777542367577553,0.045952025800943375,-0.016529222950339317,-0.009800932370126247,0.08476808667182922,0.03128949552774429,0.06694851815700531,0.007160734385251999,-0.0384